xt","text":" before you move to a new one."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Initialize the SDK","anchor":"Initialize-the-SDK"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/initialize(apiKey:completion:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" once, at launch, as the snippet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"above does, and carry on: there’s no need to wait for it or to pass a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completion. It sets your API key and prepares the PDF engine in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"background, and the SDK waits for it wherever it needs to, on both"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sides. Calling it again is harmless."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always pass your key. With "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", the default, the call only prepares"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the PDF engine: it sets no key, and calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"completion"},{"type":"text","text":" at once with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":". "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/initialize(apiKey:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the same call as an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"async"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"function."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Choose Prebuilt or Custom UI","anchor":"Choose-Prebuilt-or-Custom-UI"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With the SDK initialized, decide who builds the interface. Both sides"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"show every edition on PageSuite’s current system, classic PDF and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"responsive alike, and one app can use both."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The prebuilt UI","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" is a complete reader app you configure and brand."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"These lines, in your scene delegate in place of the placeholder root"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"view controller, show your publications’ archives and open editions in","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the prebuilt reader:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let globalConfig = GlobalConfiguration(apiKey: \"API_KEY\", accountGUID: \"ACCOUNT_GUID\")","","let carousel = CarouselViewController(","    globalConfig: globalConfig,","    sections: [.dynamicArchive(\"Editions\", shortcode: \"SHORTCODE\")]",")","window.rootViewController = carousel"],"lineAnnotations":[],"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","showLineNumbers":false},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Continue with "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReader\/documentation\/PSReader\/Prebuilt-UI","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A custom UI","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" is your own interface on the core SDK. You fetch the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"catalog, open an edition, and host the SDK’s page renderer in screens you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"design. It starts with a request like this one:"}]},{"code":["let service = FeedEditionService(accountGUID: \"ACCOUNT_GUID\")","let latest = try await service.latestEdition(publicationGUID: \"PUBLICATION_GUID\")"],"lineAnnotations":[],"wrap":0,"copyToClipboard":true,"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","showLineNumbers":false},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Continue with "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\